<br><br>
Whitney stops and turns towards you. "You get me halfway to the gate, start talking about rings,
then change your fucking mind?!"
<br><br>
<<He>> steps closer and shoves a finger against your chest. "You think you can play with me, bitch?"
<br><br>
Before you can answer, <<he>> grabs you around the waist and tries to throw you into the fountain.
<<if $physiqueSuccess>>
	You plant your feet and catch the edge of the fountain. Whitney strains against you,
	<span class="green">but cannot lift you</span>. You twist out of <<his>> arms and step away from the water.
	<br><br>
	Whitney glares at you, then clicks <<his>> tongue. "Not worth the fucking effort."
<<else>>
	Whitney hooks a foot behind your ankle and lifts you before you can brace yourself.
	<<He>> tips you over the edge and <span class="red">drops you into the fountain</span>.<<wet_upper>><<wet_lower>><<ruffleHair>>
	<<pain 6>><<gpain>>
