	You sit up in the cold water. Whitney looks down at you and clicks <<his>> tongue. "Next time, don't waste my fucking time."
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<He>> turns and leaves the park without looking back.<<npcincr Whitney love -3>><<lllove>>
