<<endevent>>
<<whitneyExit>>

:: Whitney Jewellery Walk
<<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
Whitney drags you out of the park and sets a fast pace.
You pass the shops turning on their signs while <<he>> keeps a grip around your wrist.
<br><br>
You cross the first junction, then the second. People move aside when they see Whitney coming.
Anyone who looks at you for too long receives a glare or a raised middle finger.
<br><br>
"Don't get smug," <<he>> says. "A ring doesn't mean you own me."
<br><br>
"You just threw someone into a ditch and said you already had a slut."
<br><br>
"That's different. That bitch was an annoying cunt, and you're my slut."
<br><br>
You reach High Street and enter the shopping centre. Whitney
lets go of you
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
	to shake the rain from <<his>> jacket,
<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "snow">>
	to brush the snow from <<his>> jacket,
<<else>>
	for a moment,
<</if>>
then catches your wrist before you can move towards the stairs.
"We're not getting anything with hearts on it. And if you tell anyone I agreed to this,
I'll break the fingers you put it on."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Whitney Jewellery Store]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>

