:: Whitney Jewellery Store
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "shopping_centre">><<effects>>
<<generate2>>
You lead Whitney into the jewellery store. Bright lamps shine into glass cases filled with rings,
necklaces and watches. A shop assistant approaches, and Whitney immediately releases your wrist.
<br><br>
"Can I help you?" the <<person2>><<person>> asks.
<br><br>
"We're looking for matching jewellery," you say. "Maybe rings."
<br><br>
The assistant shows you a ruby ring, a black diamond ring with a butterfly setting,
and several gold bands. You look from one case to the next, unable to choose.
<br><br>
"Something for both of us," you say, pointing towards Whitney.
<br><br>
The assistant studies your hands, then disappears into the back room. <<He>> returns carrying a black velvet box.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Whitney Jewellery Store 2]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Jewellery Store 2
<<effects>><<person2>>
"This is a limited pair," <<he>> says. "You won't find another set like it in town."
<br><br>
<<He>> opens the box. Two plain bands rest inside, each set with tiny diamonds,
red rubies and orange-pink sapphires. The stones are small, so the rings look simple, not showy.
The assistant presses one stone. A narrow section of the band opens, revealing a space inside.
<br><br>
"Your initials can be engraved here. Close the panel and nobody else can see them.
Open it when you want to show that the pair belongs together."
<br><br>
<<person1>>Whitney finally leans over the case. <<He>> takes one ring and opens the hidden panel twice.
<br><br>
<<person2>>"Useful for someone who wants privacy," the assistant says, glancing at Whitney.
"Or someone too stubborn to admit it..."
<br><br>
<<person1>>"We'll take them," Whitney says.
<br><br>
The pair costs <<printprice 50000>>.
<br><br>
<<if $worn.rings.cursed is 1>>
	<span class="red">Your cursed ring cannot be removed.</span>
	<br>
<<elseif $money gte (setup.inflation ? setup.inflation.price(50000) : 50000)>>
	<<link [[Buy the matching rings (<<printprice 50000>>)|Whitney Jewellery Buy]]>><<money -50000 "whitney">><<ringswear "initialled gemstone ring">><<set $whitneyRing to true>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You cannot afford the matching rings.</span>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Leave without buying them|Whitney Jewellery Leave]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Jewellery Leave
<<effects>><<person1>>
You close the velvet box and give it back to the assistant. Whitney says nothing until you are outside the shop.
<br><br>
"You dragged me across town when you couldn't even pay?" <<he>> says. <<He>> flicks your forehead hard.
"Bring money next time, broke bitch. I'm not standing around while you count pennies again."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Whitney Jewellery Parting]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Whitney Jewellery Buy
<<effects>><<person1>>
The assistant engraves the rings while you wait. Your initial is hidden inside Whitney's band,
and <<his>> is hidden inside yours.
<br><br>
Whitney snatches your hand before the assistant can help. <<He>> opens the small panel,
checks the letter inside, then forces the ring onto your ring finger and pushes the panel shut.
<br><br>
You take the other ring. Whitney holds <<his>> hand out and drums <<his>> fingers against the counter
until you place the band on <<his>> ring finger. <<He>> closes the panel over your initial at once.
<br><br>
<<He>> turns <<his>> hand beneath the shop lights. From the outside, only the tiny stones are visible.
"There," <<he>> says. "Nobody else needs to know what it says."
<br><br>
"You know what it says."
<br><br>
"Shut up before I make you swallow yours."
Whitney catches your jaw and pulls you into a hard kiss. <<His>> teeth catch your lower lip,
and <<he>> holds you there until you stop trying to speak.
<br><br>
"Now everyone can see you're claimed," <<he>> says against your mouth. "My ring, my initials,
my degenerate bitch. Lose it and I'll put the next one through your lip."
<br><br>
The assistant looks away. Whitney smirks, takes your wrist and leads you out of the shop with
the ring still on <<his>> finger.<<npcincr Whitney love 5>><<stress -6>><<gglove>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Whitney Jewellery Parting]]>><</link>>
